<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">1Teselonqqe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Teselonqqe Asayis xaafeez Tiina Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Teselonqqe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Teselonqqe Asayis Xaafeez Tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Teselonqqe, Oroome biitta yez Maqadoona awurajjas waanna katama. Phawuloosa Filphisoosa ashshii yhanigeezaypp guye Teselonqqe woosa keeth esseeza. Hano zin, Ayihuditay ammano ekkodayis giiginttii betteez Ayihude maaqqekka asay, Phawuloosa taamarssiza, kiristtinna ammano timirttayid gamintteez gishos Ayihuditay qinaattii, Phawuloosa timirtta phalqqeeza. Yeyi gishos, Phawuloosa gam7ekkazar Teselonqqe ashshii, Beera qiteeza (1:9-10). Guyeppe E Teselonqqe helleez wode eza maaddiza Ximaatoosa Teselonqqe woosa keetha yez hanita ees geeshshii odeeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa tiina kiita Teselonqqe asayis xaafeezay, ammaniza asa zorodayisinnee minthathodayisii. E u ammanannee u siiqo lo77o markkatitha si7ii Xoossa galatiza. Binii E u gancce yezitar ab garkk yessi yezako unttan qopisiza. Yeypp Kiristtoosa nam7inth yi7ithi bagga oycintteez oychchayis mahith inggiza. Ye oychchitaypp xiqqitay, «Kiristtoosa nam7intho ye7odaypp tiina yhayqqeez ammaniza asis Kiristtoosa yi7ithay inggiza medhina de7o ekkodayis danda7inee? Kiristtoosa nam7intho ye7oday ayide?» ginttinttizita. Phawuloosa ye giiga woda maadinttii, «Kiristtoosa nam7intho yi7itha ufayisar naagttar E ye7od hellodayis shemppii yi ooso oothoytta» yeegii zoriza.</para>
  <para style="iot">1Teselonqqe kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa ufayssannee galata <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza asay yess kaalithiza woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa nam7intho yi7ithi bagga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssith zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosa Sillaasennee Ximaatoosa Teselonqqe woosa keetha yez ammaniza asitayis, Xoossa Aday baggannee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga maaqqeez asayis xaafeez kiita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Haw. O. 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aadho keehatethaynnee saro yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Teselonqqe asay yessinnee ammana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Nuunii ubba wode Xooss woossittar yinttan qoppittar yi gishos ubba wode Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Nu Godanne Aday tiina ammanor yi ootheez oosa, siiqor yi daabureez daaburannee Yesuus Kiristtoosar yez yi ufayssa miinggii eqqeez eqa ubba wode qoppiza.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Xoossa doseez Nu ishuntho, Xoossii yinttan dooreezana nu eriza. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Abis giiko, nuunii Wonggile doona aaddar baazin wolqqar, Geeshsha Ayyanarannee Wonggile tumatithar yinttis ke7eeza. Nuunii yinttar gam7eez wode ubbayid yi gishos wayizii yezeezako yi eriza. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Yi gaame meto ekkikokka Geeshsha Ayyanay inggiza ufayisay baggar kiita ekkeeza; nunannee Goday aazisa kaalizita maaqqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Haw. O. 17:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Yeyi gishos, Maqadoonannee Akkaya biitta yez ammaniza ubbayis lo77o aaziso maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Goda qaalay yinttipp kezii, Maqadoonarannee Akkaya aadda baazin Xoossa yi ammanizay ubba aqo sintteeza. Yikkee, nuunii godbaz akkokka baaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Nuunii yinttiko yhanigeez wode yi nuna mokkeez mokanne yi, yi eeqa ashshii tumannee de7o Xoossayis oothodayis yi wayizii maaqqeezako unttii fa ommas odiza. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Ma Xooss Na7ay, Yesuusa, Xoossii yhayiqopp dentheezay, tiinapp ye7od Xoossii kachaypp nuna ashshoday, salopp ye7odana yi wayizii naagizako unttii markattiza.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Teselonqqe ootheez oosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Ta ishuntho, nuunii yinttiko yhanigeezay cere baazana yi, yi ommas eriza. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Zini nuunii yinttiko Teselonqqe ye7odaypp tiina Filphisoosa katamayid metintteezannee cazhintteeza yi eriza. Gaame ixo yezikokka yinttis Wonggile odod garkk Xoossii nuus minotithii inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Haw. O. 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Nuunii yinttan zoreezay ballithor woy tuna qofar woy gener baaya.<verse eid="1TH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Zini Xoossii nuul ammanttii fa Wonggile ododay garkk nuus hadara inggeez garkk ododa. Nu yeya ootheezay nu wozina bi7iza Xoossa ufayssodayisipp attin as ufayssodayis baaya. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Nu miishe dosii worddor yinttan saqothittar yinttiko ye7ekkaza yi loythii eriza; Xoossikka nuus markka. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Nuunii yinttapp maaqqin woy hara ooppekka bonchcho koyekkaya. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqeezay garkk nuus beeziza baz inggoytta gi ekkodayis danda7izazin inda fa na7ita dichchizay garkk yi gancce nu ashiketithar yuuyeeza. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Nu yinttan doseez gishos Xooss Wonggile yinttis shaako aadda baazin nu shemppakka yinttis inggodayis giigii betteeza. Yi nuur gaame dosinttizitta. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Nu ishuntho, nu oosannee nu daaburssa yi eriza. Yinttis Xooss Wonggile odittar, yinttan waayithaamayis qammannee gallas ootheeza.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nu de7ay yi ammanizitay kalennee Xooss tiina geeshshii, xillonnee borinttowazita maaqqii yezeezayis Xoossinnee yinttii markka. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Nuunii yinttis ommas ommas ade fa na7itayis hanizay garkk haneezana yi eriza. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Nu yinttan zoreeza, minthetheeza. Ma E kaatetithannee E bonchcha yi shaakkinttodayis yinttan xeegeez Xooss ufayssiza yess yi yezoday garkk yinttis miinthii odeezana yi eriza.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Maakka nu yi bagga gachchekkazar Xooss galatiza baz yeza, yeykka yi nuupp si7eez Xooss qaala yi ekkeez wode yinttar ammaniztayir oothiza yha qaala yi as qaala garkk baazin tuma Xooss qaala garkk ekkeeza. Yeykka Tuma Xooss qaala.<verse eid="1TH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Ta ishuntho, yi Yihuda biitta yez woosa keethitannee ezayid Kiristtoosa Yesuusa kaalliza asay garkk haneeza. Unttan Ayihuditay waaytheezay garkk yinttanakka yi biitta asay waaytheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Haw. O. 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Ye Ayihuditay Goda Yesuusannee nabita wodhdheeza; ma nunakka bayi7ith biittapp kesseezita. Unttii Xooss ufayssozitannee as ubba ixxizita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Haw. O. 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Unttii hara attozin, Ayihude maaqqekka asay attoday garkk nu unttis qaala odizanakka kayiza. Yey garkk hanii u ubba wode nagara nagaral ootheez gishos, Wurssithal, Xooss kachchay unttal afa wodhdheeza.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Teselonqqe asa maaqqii be7adayis amottiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Zini nu ishuntho, nuunii ayyanar baazin ashor yinttipp shaakinttii xiqqa wode gam7eezayid yinttan iita laamotii ashor be7adayis koyeeza. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Nu maaqqii yinttiko yhanigodayis koyeeza. Taanii ta ommas yinttiko yhanigodayis koyeeza, zin Xalahe nuna kayeeza. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Yeezin, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa yi7iza wode nu ufayssay woy nu ceeqinttiza nu zawuday oonoo? Yinttan baasannee? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Tuma yi nu bonchchitannee nu ufayssita.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Yeyi gishos, yinttan be7ekka garzho nuus danda7inttaam ixxin, Ateena katama nu aaddas attodayis qofa acceeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Haw. O. 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Yinttan zorod garkkennee ammanor minthathod garkke nuura wolla Xoossis oothizannee Kiristtoosa Wonggile odiza nu isha Ximaatoosa yinttiko azazeeza. <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Yeykka yinttan helleez metayid yinttipp oonkka guye maaqqippe. Ye bayi7ithay nuus Xooss shene maaqqeezana yi, yi ommas eriza. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Nu yinttar yez wode bayi7ith hellodana yinttis tiinatii odeeza. Yi erizay garkk haneeza. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Yey gishos, taas garzhodayis danda7inttaam ixxin, «Oonii eree Xalahe unttan paaccii nu daaburssay yhar attodeshsha» gi yi ammanay bagga erodayis Ximaatoosa yinttiko kiiteeza.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Yhatti Ximaatoosa yi kalepp yi7ii, yi ammano baggannee yi siiqo baz lo77o wore odeeza. Ma yi ubba wode nuus lo77o qoppizannee nuunii yinttan be7adayis laamotizay garkk yinttikka nuna be7adayis laamoteezana E nuus odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Haw. O. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ta ishuntho, nuunnii waaye ganccennee meto gancce yezikokka yi ammanay gishos nu miinggeeza. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Yi Godayil miinggii yeziko nu faxat yinno. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Yikkee, nuunii yinttipp denddeezayid denggeez ufayssayis Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Nuunii yinttan aafer be7adayisinne yi ammanayid pacceez baz kunthodayis qammannee gallas nu kunth wozinar Xoossa woossiza.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Xooss nu Godayinne nu Aday E nu Godayinne Yesuus Kiristtoosakka fa ommas nu yinttiko yhanigiza oga giigiso. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Nu yinttan lo7ithii dosizay garkk yi woli siiqiza siiqannee as ubba siiqiza siiqa Goday yinttis gaanthonnee gujjo. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Nu Goday Yesuus fa geeshshitayir yi7iza wode Xoossay, nu Aday tiina yi wozinay geeshshinnee boro baazita udii E yinttan minthathoda.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa ufayssiza yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Wurssitha, ta ishuntho, Xoossa ufayssodayis yi wayizii yezodayis beezizako nuuppe yi tamaareeza. Yhattekka yi yhay garkk yeziza, zin yhatti yi kaseesaypp aathii oothoday garkk Goda Yesuusa sunthayir nu yinttan woossizannee zoriza. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Nuunii Goda Yesuusa mawuter yinttan azazeez higay aayazako yi eriza.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Xoossay, yi geesh maaqqoday garkkennee lagitapp haakkoday garkk koyiza. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Yi pettay pettay, yi machchitayra geeshshatitharannee bonchchor yezodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Xooss erowannee ammanoowa as garkk lagitas tenttitor yezippatte. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Nu tiina yinttis odeezay garkkennee miinthii zoreezay garkk Goday yey garkk oothiza ubba pirddiza gishos ookka yhay garkk ammaniza oonakka naaqqodayisinnee dooshodayis beezooya. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Xoossii nuunii geeshshetithar yezoday garkkepp attin tunatithar yezoday garkk xeegekkaya. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Yeyi gishos, yha timirtta ixxiza oonkka yinttis Geeshsha Ayyana inggiza Xoossa ixxinepp attin ase baaya.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Yi woli wayizii dosodazako Xoossii yinttan taamarsseez gishos yhatti dosobagga nu yinttis ododayis koshshooya. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Ma Maqadoona biitta yez ammanizita ubba tuma yi dosiza. Zini nu ishuntho, yeezkka yi unttan usa dosoday garkk nu yinttan woossiza.<verse eid="1TH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Nuunii tiina yinttis odeezay garkk dacci gi yezoytta. Yi, yi kusher oothii yi yessis beeziza baz denggoytta. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Yey garkk haniko, ammanoowa asitay kanttayid yi bonchchinttoda; ma yinttan koshshizabazis oonakka aaddashaamii.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday maaqqii yi7ith bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Nu ishuntho, ufayssii baa as garkk yi kayadhaamay garikkennee yhayqqeez asay bagga yez tuma yi eroday garkk nu koyiza. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Nuunii, Yesuusa yhayqqeezanannee yhayiqopp denddeezana ammanizabaz maaqqiko, Xoossii Yesuusana ammanii yhayqqeezita ezar wolla ko7oda.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Goday nuus odeezay garkk nu yinttis gizay yhaya. Goday ye7od gallas hellodayis nuunii paxa yezitay, yhayqqeezitaypp tiinataamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1 Qor. 15:51-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Goday wolqqama azazor, kiitanchchitay halaqa girthara, tulitulo pugii awajor Xoossii, salopp wodhdhoda. Kiristtoosa ammanii yhayqqeezity tiinatii yhayiqopp dendoda. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Yeypp guye, ye wode nuunii shemppo yezitay, Goda carkkol eza mokkodayis shaarar ekinttoda. Yeypp guye, nuunii Godayira wolla medhinas yezoda. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Yeyi gishos, yha qaalitayid woli minthathoytta.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday yi7itha giiginttii naagoytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ta ishuntho, yhayttitay hanod laythitaynnee agintay bagga yinttis xaapodayis koshshooya. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Goday gallasay kayizo qamma yi7izay garkk ye7odana yi lo7ithii eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luq. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2 Phix. 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Asay, «Sa7a saro, akkoyka baaya» yeegodar, maachchi iqithii aykkizay garkk dhabo unttii qoppekkazin unttal afa ye7oda. Unttii aba ogerkka yesha buutaamii.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Zini nu ishuntho, ye gallasay yinttis kayizo yi7izay garkk ye7odayis yi dhuma baaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Yi ubbay poo7o asinnee gallasa yez as; nuunii qamma as woy dhuma as baaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Yeyi gishos, nuunii yhankkitay genttizay garkk genttodayis beezooya; nuunii barkkodayisnnee giigii yezodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Genttizitay qamma genttiza; mathizitayikka qamma mathiza. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Zini nuunii poo7o as maaqqeez gishos beezizay garkk yezodayis beeziza. Ammanonnee siiqo xurure garkk tiral ma77ii, atotith ufayssa ommal ola biraata barneexa garkk gaddii yezodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efi. 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Xoossii nuna nu Goda Yesuusa baggar kunth atotithi ekkoday garkk dooreezappe attin kachis doorekkaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Nuunii paxa yezin woy yhayqqin, Kiristtoosa yezeez wode ezar pettipp yezoday garkk Kiristtoosa nu gishos yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Yeyi gishos, yi tiina ootheezay garkk, pettay petta minthathoyttannee dichchoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith zorennee sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Nu ishuntho, yi gancce oothizita, yinttan kaalithoday garkkennee zoroday garkk Goday dooreezita bonchchoday garkk yinttan ta woossiza. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Unttii oothiza oosay gishos unttan usa bonchchoyttannee siiqoytta. Wolla saror yezoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Nu ishuntho, boozita kaccoytta; yashittizita minthoytta; daabureezita maaddoytta; as ubba danda7oytta yeegii nuunii yinttan zoriza. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Oonkka iita gishos iita mahaamay garkk naaginttoytta. Yi wolisinnee as ubbayis lo77o baz oothodayis miinggoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Ubba wode ufayttoytta. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Ubba wode Xooss woossoytta. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Ubba bazar galatooytta. Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar Xooss yinttapp koyizay yeya.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Geeshsha Ayyana oosa duucipatte. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Tinbbite leqqipatte. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Ubba baz faaccoytta; lo77o baza ekkoytta. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Iita ooso ubbaypp haakkoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Saro inggiza Xoossay fa ommas yinttan folo geeshsho. Nu Goday Yesuus Kiristtoosa ye7od gallasis, Xooss yi ayyana, yi shemppannee yi kuminth asetitha boro bayth naago. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Yinttan xeegizay ammanintteezaya maaqqeez gishos yeya E poloda.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Nu ishuntho, nuus Xoossa woossoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Ammaniza as ubba geeshsha yeerar sarothoytta.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Yi yha kiita ammaniza as ubbayis nabbaboday garkk Goday sunthayir yinttan ta woosiza.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay yinttar wolla maaqqo.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
